1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,515
{\an8}<font color="white">事件发生后已经过了五天</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:03,598 --> 00:00:06,893
{\an8}<font color="white">淡谷现场仍然在持续清理瓦砾堆</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:07,436 --> 00:00:11,440
{\an8}<font color="white">凄惨的事件在复兴典礼不久前发生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">因此典礼也不得不延期</font></font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:11,523 --> 00:00:15,026
{\an8}<font color="white">不知道要花多久的时间</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">才能让城镇恢复到之前的日常生活</font></font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:15,527 --> 00:00:19,072
{\an8}<font color="white">你对这次奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">引起的事件有什么看法？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:19,156 --> 00:00:20,449
{\an8}<font color="white">我觉得很荒谬</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:20,532 --> 00:00:23,160
{\an8}<font color="white">话说不觉得那样做超糟糕的吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:23,243 --> 00:00:24,745
{\an8}<font color="white">我觉得很可怕</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:24,828 --> 00:00:29,833
{\an8}<font color="white">我还以为奥特曼会保护我们</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:29,916 --> 00:00:33,837
<font color="white">网络上对奥特曼的诽谤急剧增加</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,589
{\an8}<font color="white">另一方面 对于这次事件</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:35,672 --> 00:00:38,258
{\an8}<font color="white">政府表示不做任何评论</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:00:38,842 --> 00:00:41,303
<font color="white">奥特曼真的是英雄吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:00:41,386 --> 00:00:43,513
<font color="white">抑或是祸害？</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:00:43,597 --> 00:00:45,474
<font color="white">今天我们想请观众进行投票</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:00:45,557 --> 00:00:47,350
<font color="white">并发表结果</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:00:48,101 --> 00:00:50,020
<font color="white">首先我们邀请来宾</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:00:50,103 --> 00:00:53,190
<font color="white">-今天也一起讨论这次的事件吧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-玲奈 差不多该走了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:00:53,273 --> 00:00:54,107
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:28,660 --> 00:02:30,078
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:38,378 --> 00:02:40,255
<font color="white">给你</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:40,338 --> 00:02:43,133
<font color="white">我最近运气很好…</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:44,593 --> 00:02:46,136
<font color="white">别说了 安静点</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:02:48,805 --> 00:02:50,765
<font color="white">你要找的那家伙不在这里</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:02:52,517 --> 00:02:53,852
<font color="white">他要我保管这个</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:03,862 --> 00:03:06,197
<font color="white">好久不见</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:06,281 --> 00:03:08,909
<font color="white">我就知道你会来找我</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:08,992 --> 00:03:11,328
<font color="white">真不凑巧 我现在…</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:11,411 --> 00:03:12,662
<font color="white">你看这个</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:14,164 --> 00:03:15,582
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:16,124 --> 00:03:19,044
<font color="white">没想到梅菲斯特已经展开行动了</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:19,127 --> 00:03:20,295
<font color="white">梅菲斯特？</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:22,005 --> 00:03:24,132
<font color="white">对方是什么人？在打什么坏主意？</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:25,342 --> 00:03:29,596
<font color="white">不用那么着急 他马上就会现身了</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:30,347 --> 00:03:34,976
<font color="white">不过我记得他有几个难缠的手下</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:35,644 --> 00:03:37,562
<font color="white">请多注意那点</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:38,146 --> 00:03:39,856
<font color="white">把那项情报讲得更详细些</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:41,191 --> 00:03:42,192
<font color="white">阿达多</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:03:43,693 --> 00:03:44,986
<font color="white">可恶</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:03,964 --> 00:04:05,048
<font color="white">怎么会这样？</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:07,926 --> 00:04:10,011
<font color="white">没有连上网络</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:11,721 --> 00:04:13,348
<font color="white">“虚拟装甲”？</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:14,099 --> 00:04:15,016
<font color="white">（启动）</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,151
<font color="white">传送过来了？</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:25,777 --> 00:04:27,487
<font color="white">（叶月食堂）</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:27,570 --> 00:04:29,155
<font color="white">一份每日定食</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:29,239 --> 00:04:30,448
<font color="white">还有…</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:30,532 --> 00:04:32,158
<font color="white">老样子 饭要大碗的</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:32,242 --> 00:04:33,201
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:37,497
<font color="white">远藤先生 之前遇到</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那个类似奥特曼的奇妙家伙</font></font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:38,415 --> 00:04:40,250
<font color="white">那到底是怎么回事啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:04:41,543 --> 00:04:43,086
<font color="white">我怎么会知道</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:04:47,090 --> 00:04:49,718
<font color="white">奥特曼是正义的英雄</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:04:51,636 --> 00:04:52,721
<font color="white">玲奈？</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:04:53,638 --> 00:04:58,059
<font color="white">他至今都在对抗</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">坏蛋外星人 保护我们</font></font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:04:58,143 --> 00:05:01,730
<font color="white">那样的奥特曼才不可能引起这种事件</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:03,106 --> 00:05:05,066
<font color="white">这一定是有什么误会</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:05,150 --> 00:05:08,945
<font color="white">以上是奥特曼支持派代表</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">玲奈小姐的主张</font></font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:09,029 --> 00:05:10,864
<font color="white">大谷教授 您认为呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:10,947 --> 00:05:14,284
<font color="white">我理解你想拥护奥特曼的心情</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:14,784 --> 00:05:16,828
<font color="white">但是先别感情用事</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:16,911 --> 00:05:19,164
<font color="white">我才没有呢</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:20,081 --> 00:05:22,375
<font color="white">玲奈到底在干什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:22,459 --> 00:05:24,544
<font color="white">她上这种节目没关系吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:25,545 --> 00:05:27,297
<font color="white">她真的是大笨蛋</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:28,298 --> 00:05:29,966
<font color="white">那么佐山小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:30,050 --> 00:05:35,221
<font color="white">你有听过狼、鹿和人类的故事吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:36,264 --> 00:05:37,098
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:05:37,182 --> 00:05:38,850
<font color="white">他是指什么啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:05:39,726 --> 00:05:42,979
<font color="white">-以前鹿是狼的猎物</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:05:44,564 --> 00:05:48,193
<font color="white">而人类同情了鹿</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:05:48,276 --> 00:05:50,111
<font color="white">所以驱逐了狼</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:05:51,237 --> 00:05:54,949
<font color="white">但是那么做导致鹿大量繁殖</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:05:55,617 --> 00:05:59,037
<font color="white">过多的鹿吃光了所有草木</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:01,623
<font color="white">最后导致减少了自己族群的数量</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:02,248 --> 00:06:03,958
<font color="white">所以这是想要表达什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:04,042 --> 00:06:07,420
<font color="white">这名教授想说奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:07,504 --> 00:06:10,632
<font color="white">就像是干涉狼与鹿关系</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:11,257 --> 00:06:15,178
<font color="white">结果破坏生态平衡的人类</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:15,261 --> 00:06:17,889
<font color="white">-他想说的应该是这点吧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-这样啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:17,972 --> 00:06:20,308
<font color="white">对我们地球人来说</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:20,391 --> 00:06:23,353
<font color="white">外星人的确是可怕的存在</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:06:23,436 --> 00:06:25,021
<font color="white">不过即便如此</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:06:25,105 --> 00:06:30,151
<font color="white">就能肯定奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">消灭外星人的行为是正确的吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:06:31,402 --> 00:06:33,613
<font color="white">用刚才的故事来比喻的话</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:06:33,696 --> 00:06:38,451
<font color="white">对狼来说 人类是一个威胁</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">同时也是祸害</font></font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:06:38,993 --> 00:06:44,124
<font color="white">这是同样的道理 对外星人来说</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">奥特曼也同样是祸害</font></font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:06:44,707 --> 00:06:47,085
<font color="white">-不能因为那样就说他是“祸害”…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-我承认</font></font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:06:47,168 --> 00:06:49,629
<font color="white">奥特曼或许是保护了我们</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:06:49,712 --> 00:06:51,881
<font color="white">但那是很狭隘的观点</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:06:52,465 --> 00:06:53,842
<font color="white">以宏观的视角来看</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:06:53,925 --> 00:06:59,139
<font color="white">说就是奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">让我们人类受苦也不为过</font></font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:06:59,222 --> 00:07:03,017
<font color="white">-才没那回事…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-前几天发生的事件正是如此</font></font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:03,101 --> 00:07:07,105
<font color="white">实际受害的是我们人类</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:07,188 --> 00:07:09,482
<font color="white">-但是…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-如果我们将奥特曼的正义</font></font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:07:09,566 --> 00:07:12,402
<font color="white">和我们自己的正义混淆</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:12,485 --> 00:07:16,156
<font color="white">才会让人类迈向毁灭吧</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:07:17,198 --> 00:07:20,785
<font color="white">真是的 你也让我说话啦</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:07:21,411 --> 00:07:24,122
<font color="white">-我不管你是教授还是什么 不准…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-竟然让这种偶像替他说话</font></font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:07:24,205 --> 00:07:26,416
<font color="white">-奥特曼要完蛋了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-对啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:26,499 --> 00:07:28,042
<font color="white">-什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-远藤先生</font></font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:07:28,877 --> 00:07:30,503
<font color="white">抱歉 没事</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:07:31,921 --> 00:07:34,466
<font color="white">话说回来 玲奈还好吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:07:34,549 --> 00:07:37,510
<font color="white">-真是遗憾啊 佐山玲奈小姐</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-状况对她越来越不利了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:07:38,553 --> 00:07:42,307
<font color="white">我原本还想说你应该能理解</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:07:43,433 --> 00:07:44,851
<font color="white">你指的是什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:07:46,769 --> 00:07:49,439
<font color="white">我在调查时发现一件事</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:07:50,398 --> 00:07:53,943
<font color="white">你也有家人过世了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:07:55,278 --> 00:07:59,073
<font color="white">因为被卷入光之巨人的战斗</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:05,663 --> 00:08:06,789
<font color="white">那是…</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:08:10,418 --> 00:08:12,086
<font color="white">（发表观众投票结果）</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:14,255
<font color="white">虽然两人讨论得正热烈</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:08:14,339 --> 00:08:16,216
<font color="white">不过观众投票的结果好像已经出来了</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:08:16,299 --> 00:08:17,592
<font color="white">（奥特曼是？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">祸害 英雄）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:08:17,675 --> 00:08:19,385
<font color="white">大家是怎么想的呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:08:19,469 --> 00:08:21,387
<font color="white">让我们马上来看看</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:08:22,138 --> 00:08:22,972
<font color="white">（祸害）</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:08:23,056 --> 00:08:27,685
<font color="white">嗯 对奥特曼来说</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">这结果好像有点不妙</font></font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:08:27,769 --> 00:08:28,728
<font color="white">针对这点…</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:08:30,522 --> 00:08:32,649
<font color="white">怎么了？出故障了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:08:33,733 --> 00:08:36,402
<font color="white">这是个让人开心的好消息</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:08:37,987 --> 00:08:40,323
<font color="white">真是罕见啊</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:08:40,406 --> 00:08:44,160
<font color="white">地球的人类和我们的意见竟然相同</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:54,379
<font color="white">等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:08:54,462 --> 00:08:55,588
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:08:55,672 --> 00:08:57,382
<font color="white">那是什么啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:08:59,467 --> 00:09:01,302
<font color="white">远藤先生 你看那个</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:09:11,771 --> 00:09:14,190
<font color="white">-发生了什么事？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不清楚</font></font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:09:14,274 --> 00:09:16,985
<font color="white">上空好像有股巨大的能量反应</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:09:17,569 --> 00:09:20,738
<font color="white">我们也收到电视信号被拦截的消息</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:09:23,866 --> 00:09:25,785
<font color="white">-停电了吗？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不晓得</font></font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:09:27,537 --> 00:09:29,372
<font color="white">切换到预备电源了</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:09:30,415 --> 00:09:32,458
<font color="white">各位地球人</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:09:32,542 --> 00:09:34,502
<font color="white">你们不需要害怕</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:09:35,086 --> 00:09:36,838
<font color="white">我是梅菲斯特</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:09:38,548 --> 00:09:40,925
<font color="white">我希望歼灭奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:09:41,009 --> 00:09:43,678
<font color="white">这个宇宙祸害</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:09:44,596 --> 00:09:47,015
<font color="white">-喂 快看那个</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么啊？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:09:47,599 --> 00:09:52,812
<font color="white">也就是说我的目标和大家相同</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:09:53,896 --> 00:09:59,193
<font color="white">我们总是受奥特曼的存在所威胁</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:06,618
<font color="white">他们将自以为是的正义</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">强加在弱者身上</font></font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:07,702 --> 00:10:09,329
<font color="white">用他们那股强大的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:10:09,996 --> 00:10:13,416
<font color="white">持续铲除异己</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:10:16,002 --> 00:10:18,254
<font color="white">这次奥特曼的行为</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:10:18,796 --> 00:10:22,175
<font color="white">-再次证明了他们自己…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-现在是怎么回事？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:10:22,258 --> 00:10:25,720
<font color="white">-对地球来说就是祸害</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-请等一下 会先剪掉这一段</font></font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:10:25,803 --> 00:10:28,056
<font color="white">很抱歉 请稍等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:31,225
<font color="white">但是你们不必畏惧</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:10:31,309 --> 00:10:33,436
<font color="white">地球的伙伴们</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:38,149
<font color="white">我们和你们是同志</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:10:38,232 --> 00:10:40,485
<font color="white">我们必须做到的职责</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:10:40,568 --> 00:10:42,654
<font color="white">就是断绝祸害的根源</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:10:44,822 --> 00:10:46,282
<font color="white">也就是说</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:10:46,366 --> 00:10:49,452
<font color="white">我们要排除四名奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:10:50,453 --> 00:10:52,121
<font color="white">四名奥特曼？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:04,384 --> 00:11:09,806
<font color="white">所幸我们已经成功消灭了两名奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:09,889 --> 00:11:11,682
<font color="white">-那是什么？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-待在这很不妙啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:11:11,766 --> 00:11:12,892
<font color="white">-快逃吧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-接下来</font></font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:12,975 --> 00:11:15,520
<font color="white">我们将打倒剩下的两名奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:11:16,020 --> 00:11:18,022
<font color="white">这四根柱子</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:11:19,023 --> 00:11:20,817
<font color="white">会成为他们的墓碑</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:11:21,901 --> 00:11:23,444
<font color="white">地球的伙伴们啊</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:11:24,028 --> 00:11:29,951
<font color="white">我希望你们持续守望</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我们打倒奥特曼的奋斗过程</font></font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:11:35,039 --> 00:11:36,833
<font color="white">消失了</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:11:37,667 --> 00:11:38,918
<font color="white">那到底是怎样？</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:11:41,087 --> 00:11:42,672
<font color="white">原来他是指这件事</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:11:44,090 --> 00:11:48,970
<font color="white">刚才的家伙和那艘</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">巨大宇宙飞船到底是怎么回事？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:11:53,057 --> 00:11:54,767
<font color="white">紧急电源供应器发生异常</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:11:54,851 --> 00:11:56,644
<font color="white">安全系统出问题了</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:11:56,727 --> 00:11:58,813
<font color="white">你说什么？原因是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:11:58,896 --> 00:12:00,481
<font color="white">服务器机房好像发生了异常状况</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:12:01,065 --> 00:12:03,443
<font color="white">-摄像头陆续断线了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那个…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:12:04,652 --> 00:12:06,863
<font color="white">可能只是我看错</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:12:07,488 --> 00:12:11,659
<font color="white">但在摄像头离线的瞬间</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我看到了奥特曼的身影</font></font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:12:11,742 --> 00:12:12,869
<font color="white">不会吧</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:12:12,952 --> 00:12:15,079
<font color="white">进次郎还在禁闭室里啊</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:12:15,621 --> 00:12:18,708
<font color="white">井手先生 我去看看服务器机房</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:12:18,791 --> 00:12:21,043
<font color="white">知道了 那么拜托你了</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:12:42,982 --> 00:12:44,108
<font color="white">进次郎？</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:12:48,946 --> 00:12:49,780
<font color="white">站住</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:13:09,217 --> 00:13:10,092
<font color="white">下水道？</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:13:12,887 --> 00:13:14,013
<font color="white">什么人？</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:13:27,693 --> 00:13:31,239
<font color="white">不先自我介绍就叫别人报名字啊</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:13:31,322 --> 00:13:33,074
<font color="white">你一定不受异性欢迎</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:13:47,046 --> 00:13:49,549
<font color="white">把刚才那招当成我的自我介绍吧</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:13:50,967 --> 00:13:52,051
<font color="white">是吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:14:58,075 --> 00:14:59,368
<font color="white">你到底是谁？</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:15:03,039 --> 00:15:06,417
<font color="white">究竟有什么目的？</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:15:07,251 --> 00:15:11,923
<font color="white">天啊 你没听到</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">刚才梅菲斯特说的话吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:15:23,267 --> 00:15:26,479
<font color="white">虽然我现在就想要让你消失</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:15:26,562 --> 00:15:28,981
<font color="white">不过我还有事情要先做</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:15:30,066 --> 00:15:33,861
<font color="white">但我可以告诉你一件事</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:15:36,322 --> 00:15:38,282
<font color="white">我的目的</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:15:38,366 --> 00:15:40,993
<font color="white">是解放奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:15:41,077 --> 00:15:42,328
<font color="white">解放？</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:15:42,411 --> 00:15:44,121
<font color="white">你到底要怎么…</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:15:50,795 --> 00:15:52,838
<font color="white">变得热血是件好事</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:15:52,922 --> 00:15:55,633
<font color="white">但是不要引火自焚喔</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:15:57,718 --> 00:16:00,012
<font color="white">-等一下</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-太郎</font></font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:16:00,096 --> 00:16:03,349
<font color="white">进次郎消失了 你先回来吧</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:16:04,225 --> 00:16:05,559
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:16:30,167 --> 00:16:31,752
<font color="white">你真厉害啊</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:16:31,836 --> 00:16:33,754
<font color="white">不愧是本尊</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:16:35,464 --> 00:16:39,385
<font color="white">代表你不需要虚有其表的装甲啊</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:16:39,468 --> 00:16:41,762
<font color="white">你到底想干吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:16:50,479 --> 00:16:53,983
<font color="white">但奥特曼得去死</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:17:05,578 --> 00:17:06,829
<font color="white">这是怎样？</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:17:12,585 --> 00:17:14,920
<font color="white">你就做好觉悟受死吧</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:17:19,467 --> 00:17:20,551
<font color="white">你想做什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:17:21,343 --> 00:17:22,928
<font color="white">那我就这么做</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:17:44,658 --> 00:17:46,577
<font color="white">好痛啊</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:17:47,286 --> 00:17:49,914
<font color="white">这难道不是装甲吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:18:10,309 --> 00:18:11,602
<font color="white">可恶</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:18:18,901 --> 00:18:20,653
<font color="white">你真是顽强呢</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:18:20,736 --> 00:18:23,155
<font color="white">-找到进次郎了吗？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-还没</font></font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:18:23,239 --> 00:18:26,117
<font color="white">有人表示看到奥特曼前往机库的方向</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:29,787
<font color="white">什么？安全系统的现况如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:18:34,917 --> 00:18:36,460
<font color="white">我懂了</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:18:37,086 --> 00:18:38,170
<font color="white">你这个冒牌货</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:18:38,254 --> 00:18:42,633
<font color="white">这全部都是你策划的诡计吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:14,039
<font color="white">安全系统要修复了</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:19:14,123 --> 00:19:16,500
<font color="white">-太好了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-能显示摄像头画面了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:19:18,502 --> 00:19:21,046
<font color="white">电梯正上升到直升机停机坪</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:19:34,977 --> 00:19:36,478
<font color="white">-放大影像</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好的</font></font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:19:50,075 --> 00:19:52,578
<font color="white">救救我…</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:19:56,707 --> 00:19:57,875
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:20:02,171 --> 00:20:03,297
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:20:04,924 --> 00:20:07,384
<font color="white">现在这是什么情况 进次郎？</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:20:09,261 --> 00:20:12,014
<font color="white">这家伙假扮成奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:20:12,973 --> 00:20:16,185
<font color="white">全都是他谋划的诡计</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你也看到了吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:20:16,769 --> 00:20:21,649
<font color="white">不 我只看到你杀了那名外星人</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:20:21,732 --> 00:20:24,401
<font color="white">什么？怎么这样？</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:20:25,861 --> 00:20:28,614
<font color="white">出现在复兴典礼的奥特曼也是这家伙</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:20:28,697 --> 00:20:30,032
<font color="white">绝对不会错</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:20:30,532 --> 00:20:31,992
<font color="white">你有证据吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:20:33,494 --> 00:20:35,204
<font color="white">大家应该都有看到</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:20:36,413 --> 00:20:40,125
<font color="white">我和冒牌奥特曼的打斗</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:20:40,209 --> 00:20:41,585
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:20:43,128 --> 00:20:46,006
<font color="white">因为安全系统关闭</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:20:46,882 --> 00:20:50,594
<font color="white">我们没有掌握到你刚才的状况</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:20:52,721 --> 00:20:54,682
<font color="white">怎么会这样？</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:20:54,765 --> 00:20:57,518
<font color="white">我和其他人都不觉得你会平白无故</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:20:57,601 --> 00:21:00,854
<font color="white">擅自做出这种事情</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:21:01,730 --> 00:21:02,690
<font color="white">但是…</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:21:04,024 --> 00:21:05,901
<font color="white">你为什么就是不懂？</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:21:05,985 --> 00:21:08,445
<font color="white">分明就是这家伙在搞鬼啊</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:21:09,029 --> 00:21:12,658
<font color="white">既然缺乏证据</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你的证词就没有说服力</font></font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:21:13,367 --> 00:21:15,411
<font color="white">剩下的我们会去调查</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:21:15,494 --> 00:21:17,371
<font color="white">你先回禁闭室吧</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:21:22,001 --> 00:21:23,168
<font color="white">我不能回去</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:21:25,379 --> 00:21:29,258
<font color="white">我无法再保持沉默了</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:21:32,011 --> 00:21:33,304
<font color="white">我会战斗</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:21:35,723 --> 00:21:38,183
<font color="white">-和杀死爸的犯人对决…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-进次郎</font></font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:21:38,267 --> 00:21:39,768
<font color="white">不论你有什么理由</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:21:40,602 --> 00:21:42,438
<font color="white">你想做的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:21:42,521 --> 00:21:44,440
<font color="white">不就只是报仇吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:21:52,740 --> 00:21:53,907
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:21:54,992 --> 00:21:56,660
<font color="white">如果你不愿意相信我</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:21:57,578 --> 00:21:59,288
<font color="white">即使独自一人 我也会去做</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:21:59,913 --> 00:22:00,998
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:22:15,763 --> 00:22:17,389
<font color="white">辛苦你了</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:22:19,308 --> 00:22:20,768
<font color="white">那样做就够了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:22:21,477 --> 00:22:26,607
<font color="white">一切都按照计划进行着</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻译：梁雪莹</font><font color="white"></font>

